# peer address 2001:db8:1::2 (the relay it received the message from)
20 01 0d b8 00 01 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 02
# option 9, relay message, 122 octets: the inner RELAY-FORW
00 09 00 7a
# --- inner (lightweight) relay ---
# msg-type RELAY-FORW, hop count 0
